Nestled between Philadelphia
and Pittsburgh sits the capital

00:07:46.398 --> 00:07:49.068
city of Pennsylvania. 
Harrisburg.

00:07:49.068 --> 00:07:49.568
Beyond having the unique
distinction as the training

00:07:50.202 --> 00:07:51.203
Beyond having the unique
