knee and asking their partner

00:08:38.517 --> 00:08:39.351
to marry them.

00:08:39.417 --> 00:08:40.285
but asking that man to go get
tested.

00:08:40.552 --> 00:08:43.155
Instead, this is the woman
maybe not getting down on

00:08:43.188 --> 00:08:45.992
her knee but asking that 
man to go get tested.

00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:49.996
Using HIV information from
AIDSource and MedlinePlus,

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:54.133
BGH expanded their "Pop the
Question" campaign in 2016

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:57.136
